						"value": true
					},
					"font-size": {
						"type": "number",
						"value": 19
					},
					"text": {
						"type": "text",
						"value": "SLICE IN \/ SLICE INFO\n\nThe Slice In node is used to get slices into Wire. We have a number of dummy presets like the Stage Android and 3x3 grid which can be found in the node panel.\nWhen using the patch in Arena the dummies will be replaced by the slices you add to the Effect\/Source\/Mixer.\n\nThe Slice Info node gives you all the info you need about the current slice(s). Info like name, dimension and position(measured from the center of the slice) are readily available. There are seperate nodes for Shape, Mask, Rotation and Center if you only need that.\n\nIn this example we simply render most of the Slice Info to the screen using string functions and a Text Render"
					}
				},
